{# Docs : Grid (row & col) — sources : assets/scss/layout/_row.scss, _col.scss #}

<div class="component-demo">
  <p class="docs-lead">
    Grille flexbox de 12 colonnes. Les colonnes se placent directement dans une <code>.row</code>,
    dont les gouttières passent par <code>gap</code> : aucune marge négative.
  </p>

  <section class="docs-section" id="auto">
    <h3>Largeur automatique</h3>
    <p><code>.col</code> partage l'espace à parts égales, quel que soit le nombre de colonnes.</p>
{% set code %}
<div class="row">
  <div class="col"><div class="docs-box">.col</div></div>
  <div class="col"><div class="docs-box">.col</div></div>
  <div class="col"><div class="docs-box">.col</div></div>
</div>
{% endset %}
    {% include 'docs/_example.html.twig' with { code: code } only %}
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section" id="largeurs">
    <h3>Largeurs sur 12 colonnes</h3>
    <p><code>.col-{1-12}</code> fixe le nombre de colonnes occupées ; au-delà de 12, les colonnes passent à la ligne.</p>
{% set code %}
<div class="row gy-4">
  <div class="col-8"><div class="docs-box">.col-8</div></div>
  <div class="col-4"><div class="docs-box">.col-4</div></div>
  <div class="col-3"><div class="docs-box">.col-3</div></div>
  <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.col-6</div></div>
  <div class="col-3"><div class="docs-box">.col-3</div></div>
</div>
{% endset %}
    {% include 'docs/_example.html.twig' with { code: code } only %}
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section" id="contenu">
    <h3>Largeur du contenu</h3>
    <p><code>.col-auto</code> prend la largeur de son contenu ; les <code>.col</code> voisines se partagent le reste.</p>
{% set code %}
<div class="row">
  <div class="col-auto"><div class="docs-box">.col-auto (contenu)</div></div>
  <div class="col"><div class="docs-box">.col</div></div>
</div>
{% endset %}
    {% include 'docs/_example.html.twig' with { code: code } only %}
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section" id="responsive">
    <h3>Responsive</h3>
    <p>
      <code>.col-{bp}-{n}</code> s'applique à partir du breakpoint (<code>sm</code> 576px, <code>md</code> 768px,
      <code>lg</code> 992px, <code>xl</code> 1200px, <code>xxl</code> 1400px). Sans préfixe, la règle vaut pour toutes les tailles.
    </p>
{% set code %}
<div class="row gy-4">
  <div class="col-12 col-md-8"><div class="docs-box">.col-12 .col-md-8</div></div>
  <div class="col-12 col-md-4"><div class="docs-box">.col-12 .col-md-4</div></div>
  <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="docs-box">.col-6 .col-lg-3</div></div>
  <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="docs-box">.col-6 .col-lg-3</div></div>
  <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="docs-box">.col-6 .col-lg-3</div></div>
  <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="docs-box">.col-6 .col-lg-3</div></div>
</div>
{% endset %}
    {% include 'docs/_example.html.twig' with { code: code } only %}
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section" id="decalages">
    <h3>Décalages</h3>
    <p><code>.offset-{n}</code> et <code>.offset-{bp}-{n}</code> décalent la colonne ; <code>.offset-{bp}-0</code> annule un décalage.</p>
{% set code %}
<div class="row gy-4">
  <div class="col-4"><div class="docs-box">.col-4</div></div>
  <div class="col-4 offset-4"><div class="docs-box">.col-4 .offset-4</div></div>
  <div class="col-md-6 offset-md-3"><div class="docs-box">.col-md-6 .offset-md-3</div></div>
</div>
{% endset %}
    {% include 'docs/_example.html.twig' with { code: code } only %}
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section" id="ordre">
    <h3>Ordre</h3>
    <p>Les utilitaires <code>.order-*</code> (et <code>.order-{bp}-*</code>) réordonnent visuellement les colonnes.</p>
{% set code %}
<div class="row">
  <div class="col"><div class="docs-box">1er dans le HTML</div></div>
  <div class="col order-last"><div class="docs-box">2e (.order-last)</div></div>
  <div class="col order-first"><div class="docs-box">3e (.order-first)</div></div>
</div>
{% endset %}
    {% include 'docs/_example.html.twig' with { code: code } only %}
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section" id="gouttieres">
    <h3>Gouttières</h3>
    <p>
      La gouttière horizontale par défaut est de 24px. <code>.g-{n}</code> règle les deux axes,
      <code>.gx-{n}</code> l'horizontale et <code>.gy-{n}</code> la verticale (n : 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 10, 12),
      aussi en responsive (<code>.g-md-{n}</code>).
    </p>
{% set code %}
<div class="row g-2">
  <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.g-2</div></div>
  <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.g-2</div></div>
  <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.g-2</div></div>
  <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.g-2</div></div>
</div>
<div class="row gx-8 gy-2 mt-6">
  <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.gx-8 .gy-2</div></div>
  <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.gx-8 .gy-2</div></div>
  <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.gx-8 .gy-2</div></div>
  <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.gx-8 .gy-2</div></div>
</div>
{% endset %}
    {% include 'docs/_example.html.twig' with { code: code } only %}
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section" id="imbrication">
    <h3>Imbrication</h3>
    <p>Une colonne peut contenir sa propre <code>.row</code>, qui redécoupe sa largeur en 12.</p>
{% set code %}
<div class="row">
  <div class="col-8">
    <div class="docs-area">
      <div class="row g-2">
        <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.col-6</div></div>
        <div class="col-6"><div class="docs-box">.col-6</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-4"><div class="docs-box">.col-4</div></div>
</div>
{% endset %}
    {% include 'docs/_example.html.twig' with { code: code } only %}
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section" id="personnalisation">
    <h3>Personnalisation</h3>
    {% include 'docs/_reference.html.twig' with {
      headers: ['Token', 'Défaut', 'Rôle'],
      rows: [
        ['--row-gutter-x', '<code>--ds-space-6</code>', 'Gouttière horizontale (lue par les colonnes)'],
        ['--row-gutter-y', '<code>0</code>', 'Gouttière verticale'],
      ],
    } only %}
  </section>

  <section class="docs-section" id="classes">
    <h3>Classes</h3>
    {% include 'docs/_reference.html.twig' with {
      rows: [
        ['.row', 'Rangée flex qui passe à la ligne'],
        ['.col, .col-{bp}', 'Colonne à largeur partagée'],
        ['.col-auto, .col-{bp}-auto', 'Colonne à la largeur du contenu'],
        ['.col-{1-12}, .col-{bp}-{1-12}', 'Colonne sur n douzièmes'],
        ['.offset-{1-11}, .offset-{bp}-{0-11}', 'Décalage'],
        ['.g-{n}, .gx-{n}, .gy-{n} (+ {bp})', 'Gouttières'],
      ],
    } only %}
  </section>
</div>
